<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Metroplex six-mth net up 48 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Metroplex six-mth net up 48 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to July 31</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  45.86   vs	  31.03</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	  5.76   vs	   3.91</p>
<p>    Turnover		   330.55   vs	 170.56</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    63.29   vs	  45.60</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less  3.24   vs  less   2.79</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	    0.12   vs	    -</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	  -     vs	    -</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysia's Metroplex Bhd is involved in property, hotels and leisure businesses.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
